# Breadboard Development Preferences

## User Preferences

- **NO EMOJIS**: User does not like emojis in CLI output
  - Use text-based indicators instead:
    - [OK] instead of ✓
    - [ERROR] instead of ✗
    - [WARN] instead of ⚠
    - >> instead of →
    - [ALERT] instead of 🔔
    - [INFO] instead of 📊/ℹ
    - [SYNC] instead of ⟳

## Code Style

- Keep CLI output clean and professional
- Use colored text for emphasis (green/red/yellow)
- Text-only symbols and indicators
